Package: nlestim
Type: Package
Title: Nonlinear Least Squares with Gauss-Newton and Levenberg-Marquardt
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("lunganlungpg", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "lunganlungpg@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Readable implementations of the Gauss-Newton (with optional step
    halving) and Levenberg-Marquardt algorithms for nonlinear least squares,
    with analytic derivatives from formulas, the Bates and Watts relative-offset
    convergence criterion, and the inference needed to report a fit: standard
    errors, Wald, profile-likelihood and bootstrap confidence intervals,
    confidence and prediction bands, AIC/BIC and extra-sum-of-squares F tests.
    A one-call workflow fits a set of candidate models to any dataset, compares
    them, and exports tables and plots. Ships NIST certified reference datasets
    and realistic example datasets.
